{"id":"n25347-1-7","stage":4,"title":"청춘 · 青春","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n25347-1-7-1","ko":"나도 애틋했던 청춘 시절이 있었지.","zh":"我也有过那段令人怀念的青春岁月啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나도","audio":"/audio/9630a018a2b2bf43a396.mp3"}},{"text":"애틋했던","meaning":"依恋，深情","explanation":"애틋하다：依恋，深情；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；던：修饰后面的名词，回想过去持续、反复或尚未完成的情况。","readings":[{"term":"애틋하다","audio":"/audio/647c821d24832a6ce3e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66723","senseId":"1","lemma":"애틋하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"애틋했던","audio":"/audio/2cfbdfaddc165948c7c1.mp3"}},{"text":"청춘","meaning":"青春","explanation":"청춘：青春。","readings":[{"term":"청춘","audio":"/audio/c060678376c1c4bcdf09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25347","senseId":"1","lemma":"청춘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"청춘","audio":"/audio/c060678376c1c4bcdf09.mp3"}},{"text":"시절이","meaning":"时代，岁月","explanation":"시절：时代，岁月；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"시절","audio":"/audio/4ccb6cf5cb86b6f8cebe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65302","senseId":"4","lemma":"시절","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시절이","audio":"/audio/23bb90e9402090670346.mp3"}},{"text":"있었지.","meaning":"过","explanation":"있다：过；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68796","senseId":"4","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었지","audio":"/audio/dcc57b0fdd050caa92fa.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"64